he SDK for a limited weekend promotion.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--58gMhC4P--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2012","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T19:46:40.000Z"},{"id":"UWmM8ElEY","title":"Cursor Security Review is now available for Teams and Enterprise plans.\n\nRun two types of always-on agents:\n1. Security Reviewer checks every PR for vulnerabilities and leaves comments.\n2. Vulnerability Scanner runs scheduled scans of your codebase and posts findings in Slack.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2049926283061035254","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cursor-security-review-is-now-available-for-teams-and-enterprise-plans-run-two-types-of-always-on--uwmm8eley","summary":"Cursor has launched Security Review for Teams and Enterprise plans, offering two always-on agents: a Security Reviewer that checks every pull request for vulnerabilities and leaves inline comments, and a Vulnerability Scanner that runs scheduled scans of the codebase and posts findings to Slack.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--VDukGCjf--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2002","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T18:58:06.000Z"},{"id":"ou70DSW0f","title":"Our agent harness makes models inside Cursor faster, smarter, and more token-efficient.\n\nHere's how we test improvements to the harness, monitor and repair degradations, and customize it for different models.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2049901436918436249","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/our-agent-harness-makes-models-inside-cursor-faster-smarter-and-more-token-efficient-here-s-how--ou70dsw0f","summary":"An overview of how an agent harness improves AI model performance inside Cursor by making them faster, smarter, and more token-efficient. Covers testing methodologies for harness improvements, monitoring and repairing degradations, and customizing the harness for different models.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZrL_HSsR--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2006","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T17:19:22.000Z"},{"id":"dARbtov5H","title":"Mention @\u200bCursor to kick off tasks in Slack and see updates of its work streaming in real time.\n\nCursor uses context in the thread and broader channels to create a PR for you to review and ship.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2047000517751288303","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/mention-cursor-to-kick-off-tasks-in-slack-and-see-updates-of-its-work-streaming-in-real-time-cur-darbtov5h","summary":"cursor now integrates with slack, allowing developers to mention @cursor in a slack thread to kick off coding tasks. it uses context from the thread and surrounding channels to autonomously create a pull request, with real-time streaming updates visible directly in slack.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--CxzD6vbw--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2005","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:12:09.000Z"},{"id":"FpielDuso","title":"We're partnering with SpaceX to improve Composer.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2046726224266043533","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/we-re-partnering-with-spacex-to-improve-composer--fpielduso","summary":"A partnership between SpaceX and Composer has been announced, aimed at improving the Composer tool. No further details are provided about the nature of the collaboration or what specific improvements are planned.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--qPvKM23u--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2009","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-21T23:02:12.000Z"},{"id":"U3luEdK25","title":"We've reduced memory crashes in the Cursor desktop application by 80% since February.\n\nHere's how we detect, debug, and prevent OOMs at scale.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2046654867889066190","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/we-ve-reduced-memory-crashes-in-the-cursor-desktop-application-by-80-since-february-here-s-how-we-u3luedk25","summary":"Cursor's engineering team shares how they reduced out-of-memory (OOM) crashes in their desktop application by 80% since February. The post covers their approach to detecting, debugging, and preventing memory issues at scale in the Cursor desktop app.","image":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGctl1-aoAAsDWl.png","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-21T18:18:40.000Z"},{"id":"pZQwRX2ld","title":"We recently shipped quality-of-life improvements to the Cursor CLI to make working with agents in the terminal more delightful.\n\nUse /debug to find root causes and fix tricky bugs that are hard to reproduce or understand.","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2046324136377721128","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/we-recently-shipped-quality-of-life-improvements-to-the-cursor-cli-to-make-working-with-agents-in-th-pzqwrx2ld","summary":"Cursor CLI has received quality-of-life improvements aimed at improving the agent-in-terminal experience. A new /debug command helps developers find root causes and fix tricky bugs that are hard to reproduce or understand.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--2-1xRawN--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2011","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-20T20:24:27.000Z"},{"id":"lGBDlP2WU","title":"Through the end of this weekend, we are doubling Composer 2 usage limits inside of Cursor's new agents window.\n\nEnjoy!","url":"https://x.com/cursor_ai/status/2045236540784492845","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/through-the-end-of-this-weekend-we-are-doubling-composer-2-usage-limits-inside-of-cursor-s-new-agen-lgbdlp2wu","summary":"Cursor is temporarily doubling the Composer 2 usage limits within its agents window through the end of the weekend, giving users more capacity for AI-assisted coding sessions.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s